---
// 301-equivalent redirect: /writing/ moved to /field-notes/. GitHub Pages
// serves no server-side redirects, so this uses a meta-refresh + canonical
// pointing at the new URL, plus a manual link for non-JS/no-refresh cases.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>Moved to Field Notes</title>
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://whatmattersbuilt.co/field-notes/" />
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/field-notes/" />
</head>
<body>
  <p>This page moved to <a href="/field-notes/">/field-notes/</a>.</p>
</body>
</html>
